 Fakes server (separate process; default `127.0.0.1:8766`; started with `--outbox keyed|blind --port 8766`). The replies to `POST /fake/outbox`, `GET /fake/outbox` and `GET /fake/info` (and the 422 `refused` reply of `POST /fake/outbox` and `POST /fake/crm`, and the 200 reply of `POST /fake/crm`) carry `"mode":"keyed|blind"` (the outbox mode, or the CRM mode for the CRM routes); `GET /fake/crm`, `POST /fake/control`, `POST /fake/reset` and the `bad_body`, `bad_control` and `not_found` errors do not.
